# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public repository: allow-list.
#
# Everything at the top level is ignored by default. Only the paths listed
# below are allowed into the repository, so anything that appears later stays
# out until it is allowed here on purpose.
#
# The pattern must be "/*" and not "*". "*" also matches files inside the
# allowed directories, and Git cannot re-include a file while a parent
# directory of it is excluded, so a plain "*" would leave the allowed
# directories empty.
#
# Nothing is deleted by these rules. Excluded files stay on disk; they are
# simply not tracked. This is the working archive, not the published subset.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.dockerignore
!/.env.example
!/.github/
!/.vscode/
!/Dockerfile
!/README.md
!/compose.yaml
!/pyproject.toml
!/requirements.lock.txt
!/deploy/
!/scripts/
!/sql/
!/src/
!/tests/

# The frozen 40-question evaluation set is an input, not an experiment output:
# scripts/evaluate_model.py reads it and scripts/freeze_query_cases.py writes
# it. Everything else under research/ stays local.
!/research/
/research/*
!/research/module2/
/research/module2/*
!/research/module2/query-cases-v1.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rules that apply inside the allowed directories.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.local/
.private/
**/private/
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/database.json
**/model.json
**/*.dump
**/*.csv
**/*.csv.gz
**/*.xlsx
**/*.docx
**/*.pdf
mimic-iv-clinical-database-demo-*/
research/environment/downloads/
evidence/**/raw-journal*
research/phase1/sources/
research/**/sources/
evidence/official-docs/*.txt
